## Summary: The Full Flow

```
GitHub Codespaces
    └─ pip install + test locally
    └─ docker build → creates image
    └─ docker push → uploads to DockerHub

Any Machine (your laptop, VPS, etc.)
    └─ git clone (or just copy docker-compose.yml)
    └─ docker compose up -d
        ├─ FastAPI app starts on :8000  (Studio UI + API)
        └─ n8n starts on :5678
               └─ HTTP Request nodes call http://video-generator:8000/...
                       └─ Videos generated, stored in container volumes
                       └─ Webhook fires back to n8n with download URL
```
